    <ns1:altLabel xml:lang="en">06</ns1:altLabel>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">At least 10% of the bud burst. Leaves appear between the scales. In pines, the bud lengthens and the needles remain inside their sheath which takes a silver tint; we see the green base of the needles. In other conifers, the needles begin to be visible.</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
