    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Measure of the Caliber in linhas (1 linha = 2,256 mm). The cork plank can be divided in 2 major classes regarding the thickness: Delgada (thin) (6 to 8 linhas or 14 to 27 mm) and Rolhável (stoperble) (12 to &gt; 18 linhas or 27 to &gt; 40 mm).</ns1:definition>
