    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Assessment of the date when the first flowers are sexually mature. For flowers with petals: petals are spread out and stamens release pollen. For male flowers in catkins: stamens are visible and release pollen. Other male flowers: stamens are visible and release pollen.</ns1:definition>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">BBCH_60 evaluation</rdfs:label>
  </ns3:Class>
