    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Assessment of the date when 70% of flowers are sexually mature. For flowers with petals: petals are spread out and stamens release pollen. For male flowers in catkins: stamens are visible and release pollen. Other male flowers: stamens are visible and release pollen.</ns1:definition>
